  message: "[REVIEW 2026-11-15: REAL TODAY, TEXT PARTLY STALE] 2026-11-15, dev e2b6ab8096. `NewType` has 0 uses in packages/, scripts/, docs/. Symbol.id, Edge.id/src/dst, AnalysisRun.config_fingerprint are `str`; Symbol.stable_id/shape_id are `Optional[str]`. `make_node_id` (named in the description) does not exist; the Symbol.id factory is `make_symbol_id` (base.py:597). INV-lidul is satisfied (2026-06-17), so that rationale is void; `compute_config_fingerprint({})` still returns sha256:44136fa355b3678a, and a fixture run shows 81 distinct fingerprints over 81 runs, none equal to it. INV-kurup is violated (open). scripts/check-id-construction exits 0 and is in .githooks/pre-commit:433. Full review: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/stable_id_items_review_11152026/reports/WI-tapak.md. No status or priority change made by this review."  # 9651
